 ## Subtopics
 
+### [Neural Mixture of Planar Experts (NeurMiPs)](12427-neural-mixture-of-planar-experts-neurmips.md)
+Neural Mixture of Planar Experts (NeurMiPs) is a scene representation that models geometry and appearance using a collection of local planar experts, each defined by a 2D rectangle and a neural radiance field. It distinguishes itself from volume-based methods by being sample-efficient and reflecting true surface geometry, while offering higher rendering speed and lower memory usage than neural surface rendering. [NeurMiPs](12427-neural-mixture-of-planar-experts-neurmips.md)
+
 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Performance:** Achieves high PSNR with high compression ratios. On combustion data, it achieves 60.24 dB PSNR at 1,951× compression. On ionization data, it achieves 50.73 dB PSNR at 24,878× compression [S1, unofficial].
